# display_new_refusals: rvg_display_create refuses a port >= the port count (1 by default, RVG_ERR_PORT_OUT_OF_RANGE), a port already in use (RVG_ERR_PORT_IN_USE), and a serial number already reserved anywhere in the process (RVG_ERR_SERIAL_IN_USE). A refused display unreserves its serial again, and releasing a display frees both its port and its serial.
